\end_inset

, is negative semi-definite.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Proof
Parallel to Theorem M.D.4 in Mas-Colell (1995).
\end_layout

\begin_layout Corollary*

\series bold
\shape up
(7).

\series default
 
\emph on
Let 
